# Normalize line endings so Windows checkouts don't rewrite the whole tree as
# "modified" (416 files appeared changed with zero content difference).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp4 binary

# Secrets are handled by .gitignore, not here. Note that gitattributes does not
# support negative patterns - a "!path" line is ignored and makes every git
# command print "Negative patterns are ignored in git attributes".
# Local .env files are text: they stay diffable in case one is ever force-added.
